  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your opening sneak attacks are enhanced by your focus on inflicting punishment.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Sneaking Precision<sup>UC</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You need not spend a swift action to apply the effects of a critical feat when using Sneaking Precision. As a swift action, you can expend one use of mythic power to apply the effects of one critical feat you know to an opponent you successfully sneak attack for the first time on your turn even if you do not confirm a critical hit.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-general-n-s-feats#toc66\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
